  "objects": [
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 19,
      "text": [
        "A slot cut square into the face of the rock, and the cut is not weathered.",
        "Whoever made it did not chisel it. There are no tool marks at all.",
        "A rope is strung across the mouth with a card on it: FOUNDATION SURVEY. NO ENTRY."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 19,
      "y": 24,
      "text": [
        "POST 15, and the last one. The count runs out here, at the Rock.",
        "Under the number, in the same paint as every post since Emberfall:",
        "MIREHAVEN. FOUR THOUSAND SOULS AND NOT ONE FOOT OF GROUND."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 36,
      "text": [
        "The tide board on the quay post. Somebody marks the water on it every morning.",
        "The marks climb for nine feet and then stop climbing, three years ago, exactly",
        "where the decks are. That is not luck. That is where they rebuilt them to."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 18,
      "y": 12,
      "text": [
        "The Landing board, on the west rail. Sailings, tides, and the channel notice.",
        "Under them, newer and better printed: SURVEY VESSELS HAVE PRIORITY AT THE STAIRS.",
        "Somebody has written NO under it eleven times in eleven different hands."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 27,
      "text": [
        "THE MIRE CLINIC. Open all hours, which out here means all of them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 27,
      "text": [
        "THE PROVISIONER. Lamp oil sold at cost, by order of the town."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "script",
      "x": 34,
      "y": 23,
      "text": [
        "THE VENOM HALL OF MIREHAVEN. Keeper Tallow. Knock and wait; she will be up."
      ]
    },
